 "agentCfg.key.GIO_HOTPATCH_URL": "Hotpatch mirror URL",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_HOTPATCH_URL.sub": "The address game clients download the official fixes from. Empty = http://<public IP>:<agent port>/hotpatch. Set it for a reverse proxy, another port or HTTPS; it takes effect at the next Enable of the fixes.",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_KEEP_ENV": "Keep .env settings",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_KEEP_ENV.sub": "The agent leaves each server's own .env as it is: it replaces none of the vendor's published passwords (MySQL root, Flask key — nor the MUIP sign key or the stack internal password) and does not rewrite OUTER_IP. The passwords can still be changed under Server secrets. While it is on, Local bind IP is not applied. After switching it off, fill in Local bind IP if other machines must reach a server whose .env still has 127.0.0.1.",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_MUIP_HOST": "MUIP address (GM commands)",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_MUIP_HOST.sub": "Where the agent sends the GM commands it signs. Empty = worked out per version from the stack's local IP (http://<OUTER_IP>:21051) — leave it empty unless muipserver runs elsewhere.",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_PATHFINDING": "Pathfinding server on new stacks",
