 "agentCfg.key.GIO_PROVISION_MODE": "Automatic save import",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_PROVISION_MODE.sub": "When the agent imports the shipped pre-GAA save on its own: once, the first time a version is prepared; at every switch to another version (the players' progress on it is wiped each time); or never — only when you ask for it. A server prepared with “keep my progress” or “configuration files only” is never imported over.",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_SERVER_NAME": "Server name",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_SERVER_NAME.sub": "The name players see in the launcher's server status. Empty = the machine's host name; a name set in the player-accounts policy wins over both.",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_TLS_PINNED_FALLBACK": "Checksum fallback for downloads",
 "agentCfg.key.GIO_TLS_PINNED_FALLBACK.sub": "When the certificate of a download whose checksum and size are known beforehand cannot be verified (an old root store, an antivirus that inspects HTTPS), the download is repeated without the certificate check, and the file is kept only if its checksum and size match. Never used for anything else.",
