 "deploy.done.fetchStarting": "The server package download starts now — follow it on the Server page.",
 "deploy.done.hint": "Relic saved the connection. Keep the token secret — whoever has it controls the server.",
 "deploy.done.hintFailed": "Write this token down before closing. The installer may already have applied it on the server, and it is shown nowhere else — you will need it to connect, or to undo the change.",
