 "hotpatch.voice.fromBundle": "from the archive.org bundle",
 "hotpatch.voice.hint": "While the fixes are enabled, the game checks the voice language it uses — on a fresh profile that is the Windows display language (Japanese, Korean or Chinese pick that voice, everything else English) — and downloads every missing pack from this server at login. A voice language installed with the game (or added later from Relic's Library) needs nothing from here; a player whose game uses a language that is NOT installed gets a download error at every login unless it is mirrored here. Text languages are never affected.",
