 "server.agentState.restored": "The agent's state file was damaged and has been restored from its last good copy ({at}; the damaged file is kept as {copy}). The most recent change may be missing. Automatic provisioning stays off for any version without a provisioning record until you re-apply its progress explicitly; this note goes away after a successful start once every installed version has a record.",
 "server.agentState.unreadableBody": "The agent cannot read {path} ({error}). Until the file is repaired by hand or reset, the agent refuses every change — start, prepare, progress, secrets, policy — and never provisions anything on its own. Stopping a server still works; signups and player commands are off, and no open-administration key is handed out — whoever already holds one keeps administering until the file is repaired and the option switched off, or the state is reset. Repair the file on the server and press \"Check\", or reset the state.",
