 "shell.cert.body": "Windows will ask whether you trust a certificate called “DO_NOT_TRUST_FiddlerRoot”.\r\n\r\nPress “Yes”.\r\n\r\nWithout it, the game cannot be redirected to the private server — that is all the certificate does. It is generated locally, on your computer, requested only once and removed automatically when you uninstall Relic.",
