 "shell.preflight.absentBody": "Version {version} is not installed on this server — it has {hosted}. The game will start, but you will not be able to connect on version {version}.\n\nPlay a version this server has (install it from the Relic library if needed), or switch to another server. Do you really want to open the game now?",
 "shell.preflight.absentBodyNone": "This server has no game version installed right now, so version {version} has nothing to connect to. The game will start, but you will not be able to connect.\n\nDo you really want to open the game now?",
 "shell.preflight.absentTitle": "Relic — version {version} is not on this server",
 "shell.preflight.degradedBody": "The server is running, but a few services are down ({degraded}) and are being restarted automatically right now — this usually takes a minute or two. If you enter the game before they are ready, you will be stuck on a white screen.\n\nWait a little and try again, or start anyway. Do you really want to open the game now?",
 "shell.preflight.degradedBodyNoList": "The server is running, but a few services are down and are being restarted automatically right now — this usually takes a minute or two. If you enter the game before they are ready, you will be stuck on a white screen.\n\nWait a little and try again, or start anyway. Do you really want to open the game now?",
 "shell.preflight.degradedTitle": "Relic — the server is repairing itself",
